  "scenario_name": "Shadow IT: the shortcuts",
  "titleScreenName": "Shadow IT",
  "scenario_brief": "You're on an authorised exercise at Tarrowby Logistics, a fictional firm. This one is about shadow IT: staff using devices, apps, accounts or services that IT doesn't know about or hasn't approved, usually as a shortcut. Client files are due by Monday and the file share has slowed to a crawl. First you make the calls anyone would under a deadline, then see, six months on, where each shortcut led. In between you can try the attacker's side, leaving an unlabelled USB stick where staff will find it. Then you sort an inbox of USB sticks that turned up and 'quicker way' messages, and match each shortcut to the approved way. Only the inbox is scored.",
  "endGoal": "Play out the Friday, then sort the inbox and match the swaps at the training kiosk.",
